WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.140
Grandma got indefinitely detained now

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:12.120
trying to come visit Christmas eve.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:15.800
You could claim she had a right to counsel

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:20.640
but some folks in the Congress disagree.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:24.260
She was flying home to our house

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:28.120
but she got stopped by TSA.

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:31.460
Thought she might be Abdulmutallab

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:35.960
when they had a look at grandma's old x-ray.

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:40.000
Her hair had recently been colored

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.940
she paid cash for her Christmas gifts.

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:47.280
Two things apparently the Congress

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:51.820
has determined might make you a terrorist.

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:55.800
Grandma got indefinitely detained now

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:59.500
trying to come visit Christmas eve.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:03.400
They took her rights in order to protect her rights,

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:07.820
the most genious plan ever in history.

00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:11.980
But see we need to have these powers

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:16.060
to help protect this free country.

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.080
But if it takes these steps to do so

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:23.540
what is it exactly we are protecting?

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:28.000
Now she's an enemy combatant

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.960
as if that makes any sense.

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:34.960
The only thing that she's combating

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:39.360
is her unpredictable incontinence.

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:43.340
Grandma got indefinitely detained now

00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:47.280
trying to come visit Christmas eve.

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:51.020
You could claim there's no right to due process

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:55.260
but check the 5th Amendment and you'll see.

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:59.160
Grandma got indefinitely detained now

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:03.040
never made it home on Christmas day.

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:06.900
She always wanted to live in Miami

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:10.220
at least she's just 90 miles away.

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:17.840
Merry Christmas.

